<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/doi-10-3389-fninf-2012-00022> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r22ad3a3b5ada673ac9ad3b50_n9e082f4d4ae84a5f9f7f797b32865327b14 .
