_:r0591a29e9d3094f8b68eeace_n8a5a27a312db42f49be95be9f490b274b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "2013" .
_:r0591a29e9d3094f8b68eeace_n8a5a27a312db42f49be95be9f490b274b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/locator> .
