_:r2fec26c7b4bd59b32940b6df_n64d248cc060f402782ff109054a2c58bb6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Decoding the Large-Scale Structure of Brain Function by Classifying Mental States Across Individuals" .
_:r2fec26c7b4bd59b32940b6df_n64d248cc060f402782ff109054a2c58bb7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> .
