_:r6228548dacdb67faeed386cc_n329a3a5f393748fe8b78d732196cdc3bb4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r6228548dacdb67faeed386cc_n329a3a5f393748fe8b78d732196cdc3bb4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Turnkey research software platform for all aspects of the neuroscientific research process. Provides a comprehensive suite of readily usable and fully integrated software with robust testing and deployment infrastructure." .
